{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>AspectArc 是一款在本機處理媒體的比例工作室，適合需要把同一段影片或相片快速改成直式短片、方形貼文、橫幅與縮圖等格式的創作者；現時限時免費，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-210.webp\">\n<h2>交付前檢查裁切風險</h2>\n<p>AspectArc 支援影片與相片比例轉換，提供 Fit 與 Fill 模式、焦點控制及安全區疊加，方便製作直式短片、方形貼文、橫幅與縮圖。2.1 版本加入 Delivery Audit，可在輸出前檢查平台格式、解像度、安全區覆蓋、裁切風險與時長限制，並以分數、警告及修正建議提示問題。另有多比例批次輸出、畫質與編碼控制，以及模糊、純色、漸變、鏡像留邊樣式。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-258-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-259-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-260-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-261-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-262-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AspectArc</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:58:46.586740+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:54:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:17:45.603233+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:57:36.245716+00:00","content_hash":"a46057c96eb15e44c03d199f6bf78e8dffa84544a0d33dfdea488797e989e7d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}